# Batch files must arrive with CRLF, whatever the cloner's core.autocrlf is set
# to. cmd.exe mis-parses multi-line blocks and labels in LF-only .bat files,
# which would break the launchers for anyone who cloned with autocrlf disabled
# or on a non-Windows machine.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary assets, never line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
